---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout 
	title="Privacy Policy" 
	description="Our commitment to your privacy. Learn how we handle your data at CountDaysBetween.">
	<section class="max-w-4xl mb-24 w-full mx-auto prose dark:prose-invert">
		<div class="prose-content w-full">
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tighter mb-8" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="text-lg text-body mb-8" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">Last updated: June 11, 2026</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">1. Introduction</h2>
			<p style="width:100%; max-width:800px">
				Welcome to CountDaysBetween.com. We value your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This privacy policy explains how we handle your information when you visit our website and use our date calculation tools.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">2. Data Collection</h2>
			<p style="width:100%; max-width:800px">
				Our date calculator tools are designed to work without requiring any personal information. We do not store the dates you enter or the results of your calculations. We may collect non-identifiable usage data to improve our services and understand how our site is being used.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">3. Cookies</h2>
			<p style="width:100%; max-width:800px">
				We use minimal cookies to enhance your experience, such as remembering your theme preference (dark/light mode). These cookies do not track your personal activities across other websites.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
			<p style="width:100%; max-width:800px">
				We may use third-party analytics services to monitor site traffic. These services may collect information sent by your browser, such as your IP address and browser type, in accordance with their own privacy policies.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-4" style="width:100%; max-width:800px">5. Contact Us</h2>
			<p style="width:100%; max-width:800px">
				If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us through our contact page.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>